          style={{
            padding: "12px 26px",
            backgroundColor: "#1a2744",
            color: "#fff",
            borderRadius: 10,
            fontWeight: 800,
            fontSize: 15,
            textDecoration: "none",
            display: "inline-block",
            boxShadow: "0 2px 8px rgba(26,39,68,0.25)",
          }}
        >
          🏠 На головну
        </Link>
      </div>
